@ [method] seven_fold_specification_explosion

& [Fold1IdentityAndPurpose] distinguishes the runtime identity
  + Cantor owns a deterministic external semantic coordination frame shared by independent inference jobs
  + the frame is transportable machine state and never claims shared KV cache hidden state consciousness truth or proof by consensus
  + the P0 purpose is to let participants propose typed changes inspect one canonical successor apply backpressure freeze one candidate attest the same digest and seal a stable checkpoint
  + imagination is a subordinate non-authoritative branch from an already sealed reality frame

& [Fold2ActorsAuthorityAndBoundaries] assigns obligations instead of generic votes
  + a participant has stable identity and one or more declared faculty roles
  + Observer Honesty and Security are mandatory settlement gates
  + Scribe Refiner Planner and Weaver may contribute subject to the exact policy and deployment topology
  + acknowledgement means the participant accepts exact frame identity under its role obligation and never means the proposition is externally true
  + Scribe may inscribe or transport declared authority but cannot create its own boot or settlement authority
  + every external model provider network tool and effect broker remains outside the pure P0 runtime

& [Fold3DataAndRelationships] forms the canonical graph
  + SharedAttentionFrame has generation predecessor digest purpose participants policy propositions constraints pinned SOP anchors challenges evidence capacity status applied deltas and two digests
  + Proposition has identity text epistemic class source references evidence references and optional dream lineage
  + FrameDelta targets one exact base generation and digest and carries one or more typed operations
  + FrameAttestation targets one frozen candidate digest and carries acknowledge challenge or defer
  + DreamFrame targets one sealed reality digest and carries purpose invariants relaxed assumptions forbidden effects hypotheses consequences evidence requirements falsifiers lineage status and digest
  + SettlementReceipt and BackpressureReceipt preserve decisions without hidden mutation
  + every set and map uses deterministic ordering and every identity-bearing carrier rejects unknown serialized fields

& [Fold4TransitionsAndOperators] closes the executable state machines
  + RECONCILE validates all deltas against one base sorts them deterministically detects target conflicts applies one atomic successor and increments generation once
  + stale base conflicting target unauthorized participant unknown reference duplicate identity and digest mismatch refuse the entire batch
  + delta operators are ADD_PROPOSITION REPLACE_PROPOSITION REMOVE_PROPOSITION ADD_CONSTRAINT REMOVE_CONSTRAINT PIN_ANCHOR RELEASE_ANCHOR ATTACH_EVIDENCE RAISE_CHALLENGE RESOLVE_CHALLENGE SET_FOCUS and RELEASE_FOCUS
  + PREPARE freezes a working frame only when no unresolved challenge exists
  + SETTLE seals only when every required participant acknowledges the exact candidate digest and the Observer Honesty and Security faculty gates are represented
  + CHALLENGE or DEFER prevents sealing and returns a revision-required or deferred receipt
  + FORK_DREAM requires a sealed parent then opens one sandboxed branch
  + REVIEW_DREAM may move OPEN to TESTING VERIFIED or DISCARDED under explicit evidence and gate rules
  + PROJECT_PROMOTION produces a normal typed reality-frame delta and never edits reality directly

& [Fold5CapacityBackpressureAndRecovery] makes the streaming bound executable
  + context accounting has pinned anchors current focus retrieved associations recent stream and reserved headroom
  + all five regions must fit the declared context budget without arithmetic overflow
  + canonical serialized bytes are the P0 deterministic proxy unit and are not advertised as tokenizer-exact tokens
  + a delta batch whose novelty exceeds headroom yields BUFFERED with the exact base digest required headroom available headroom and recovery actions
  + backpressure leaves the frame unchanged and directs freeze classify cluster prioritize split compact reconcile and resume
  + COMPACT is a separate exact-base Refiner transition that preserves semantic records reduces only removable working-set regions records evidence and recomputes reserved headroom
  + a later tokenizer-aware adapter may replace the byte proxy only under a new profile and conformance evidence

& [Fold6TruthSafetyAndProof] preserves epistemic and security integrity
  + proposition classes are OBSERVED INFERRED ASSUMED IMAGINED and VERIFIED
  + only DreamFrame may introduce IMAGINED propositions and reality promotion cannot silently label them OBSERVED or VERIFIED
  + unresolved challenges block candidate preparation
  + a dream requires at least one forbidden effect and cannot authorize or execute any effect
  + dream verification means declared branch evidence and review conditions were satisfied and is not universal truth
  + deterministic replay must reproduce byte-identical machine forms and digests
  + tests must cover success stale base conflict capacity pressure settlement gates dissent dream isolation stale parent and promotion non-mutation

& [Fold7PruningGrowthAndPhaseLock] selects the smallest falsifiable vertical slice
  + retain pure Rust forms validation reconciliation settlement dream branching review promotion projection receipts and tests
  + retain one local CLI experiment only after the pure core passes if it materially proves JSON transport and multi-participant replay
  + prune network streaming llama.cpp modification sockets persistent storage distributed consensus cryptographic participant signing autonomous effects FPGA and deployment from P0
  + reuse existing SemanticId ContentDigest FacultyKind and SHA-256 canonical serialization helpers
  + do not overload the older two-process ProcedureCoordination kernel because its identity is instruction scheduling while this identity is semantic-frame governance
  + later growth may adapt provider streams transports signed participants durable logs token-aware budgets and three-machine faculty views around the unchanged pure core
  + [exhaustion_state] is seven_fold_phase_locked_for_pure_P0

& [Flowchart] is the implementation-graduation surface
  + S0 sealed or working base frame
  + S1 collect typed deltas against one base
  + S2 validate identity authority digest operation references and capacity
  + S3 atomically reconcile one working successor or emit immutable refusal receipt
  + S4 repeat passes until participants submit no further semantic changes
  + S5 freeze candidate and distribute exact digest
  + S6 collect role-bound attestations
  + S7 seal same digest or return revision deferred or fault
  + D0 fork dream from S7
  + D1 widen associate vary and project inside sandbox
  + D2 challenge test and refine
  + D3 verify or discard
  + D4 emit promotion delta back to S1 without mutating S7

& [DualHemisphereReview] reconciles exploration and execution
  + holistic side preserves shared-dream streaming imagination association and faculty-composition potential
  + delineating side separates reality from hypothesis semantic agreement from truth bytes from tokens and external orchestration from pure state transition
  + reconciliation keeps the broad graph shape while giving every transition a closed machine boundary and falsifiable result

& [ResidualFrontier] remains explicit
  + provider adapters must decide when to request another inference pass
  + transport protocols must preserve ordering authentication retry and replay identities
  + actual context token accounting depends on the selected model tokenizer
  + role competence and evidence quality require evaluation beyond deterministic structural validation
